.TH "mtx-flac" "1" "01-01-2026" "version 0.10" "ConTeXt Flac Helpers"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
 mtx-flac \- ConTeXt Flac Helpers
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mtxrun --script flac [
.I OPTIONS ...
.B ] [
.I FILENAMES
.B ]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B ConTeXt Flac Helpers
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B --collect
collect albums in xml file
.TP
.B --pattern
use pattern for locating files
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
More information about ConTeXt and the tools that come with it can be found at:


